# SPY block print event study (2022-01-03 to 2026-10-16, 3226 prints on 961 days)
Data audit: outcomes.market_price is the prior-day dividend-adjusted close, not the price at print. The file's direction/deviation columns are 94 pct 'above_market' by construction (deviation falls 5.5 pct in 2022 to 0.4 pct in 2026, the dividend signature), and its forward window starts at the prior close so Spec A 1d returns contain the print-day move (lookahead). Spec A runs the tests as filed; Spec B re-references every print to the same-day raw close rebuilt from closing-auction prints (max error 0.05 bp), starts the clock at that close, and is the headline. 1940 prints sit within 1bp of the close (MOC style) and are excluded from above/below.
